# Everything in `assets/` is produced by the `prebuild` script: the KoliBri icons and favicon
# copied from `@public-ui/components`, and the Carbon icon font built by `@public-ui/d-you-icons`
# in `icons/`. Only the theme's own variant sample data is authored by hand and therefore tracked.
assets/*
!assets/variants/
assets/variants/*
!assets/variants/inject-variants_dyou.json

# Design source of the theme, see STYLEGUIDE.md. Kept out of the repository because the
# screens are several megabytes of PNG; they live in the design hand-off, not in git.
figma/

test-results/
